<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Welcome Email</title>
  <style>
    /* Inline CSS for email clients */
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; }
    .button { background: #4CAF50; padding: 12px 18px; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Welcome, {{first_name}}!</h2>
    <p>Thanks for joining us — we're excited to have you here.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="{{cta_link}}" class="button">Get Started</a>
    </p>
    <p>If you have questions, just reply to this email.</p>
    <p>{{unsubscribe_link}}</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
